    "All six byte/word immediate/extended/indexed combinations and all236x236 indexed pairs use sequential source-then-destination semantics",
    "Source auto changes influence a shared destination base; both changes commit only after accepted destination write",
    "HCS12 PC-relative operands use the complete next instruction; original M68HC12 move-queue variant remains explicitly unsupported",
    "Source data is captured before overlapping/wrapping big-endian word writes; all CCR and nonselected registers stay unchanged",
    "Known RAM is accessed natively; external logical byte/word accesses preserve original unretired CPU state and exact refused phase context",
    "Partial-window word seams delegate the complete actual wide access; refused partial destination effects remain without rollback/replay",
    "Legal destination calculation preserves the captured value and needs no host frame or runtime ISA helper",
    "Authored17-word MOVW/DBNE block uses two native cache entries, dynamic Y/SP/counter state and exactly34 retirements; independent per-MOV value domains supplement its block data-equality check"
  ],
